s. I retried the same rollback once and it completed.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The service reports healthy, with the error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to open the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already open with the full summary, so I did not create a duplicate. The on-call engineer was paged by that request.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 failed before redeploying it, and look into the orchestrator partial failure that left the rollout mixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}